# NVIDIA driver branches built into the AL2023 GPU AMI as per-version driver trees, when nvidia_driver_trees is on.
#
# One line per branch: <name> <flavors...>. The first line is the default branch, pinned by nvidia_driver_version_al2023
# like the natively installed driver; every other branch is pinned in nvidia_driver_tree_versions_al2023. Each branch
# becomes a tree under /opt/nvidia/<name> with kernel modules for the flavors listed. Build only the flavors the GPUs
# that use the branch need: Blackwell and newer GPUs are open-only.
lts open proprietary grid
pb open
